{
  "sections": {
    "main": {
      "type": "main-product",
      "blocks": {
        "vendor": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "{{ product.vendor }}",
            "text_style": "uppercase"
          }
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "price": {
          "type": "price",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "variant-picker": {
          "type": "variant_picker",
          "settings": {
            "picker_type": "button",
            "swatch_shape": "circle"
          }
        },
        "quantity-selector": {
          "type": "quantity_selector",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "buy_buttons": {
          "type": "buy_buttons",
          "settings": {
            "show_dynamic_checkout": true,
            "show_gift_card_recipient": true
          }
        },
        "product-inventory": {
          "type": "inventory",
          "settings": {
            "text_style": "body",
            "inventory_threshold": 10,
            "show_inventory_quantity": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "vendor",
        "title",
        "price",
        "description",
        "variant-picker",
        "quantity-selector",
        "buy_buttons",
        "product-inventory"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "enable_sticky_info": true,
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "media_size": "medium",
        "constrain_to_viewport": true,
        "media_fit": "contain",
        "gallery_layout": "stacked",
        "media_position": "left",
        "image_zoom": "lightbox",
        "mobile_thumbnails": "show",
        "hide_variants": true,
        "enable_video_looping": false,
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "envio": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "truck",
            "heading": "Envío y entrega",
            "row_content": "<p>Envío gratis a todo el mundo. La entrega tarda de 7 a 15 días laborables y recibes el número de seguimiento por email en cuanto tu pedido sale del almacén.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tallas": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "ruler",
            "heading": "¿Qué talla elijo?",
            "row_content": "<p>Cada producto incluye su propia tabla de tallas. Mide tu cintura y compárala con la tabla antes de pedir. Si estás entre dos tallas, elige la mayor: la prenda debe moldear, no apretar.</p>"
          }
        },
        "cuidados": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "washing",
            "heading": "Cuidado y lavado",
            "row_content": "<p>Lava a mano o en ciclo frío con jabón neutro, sin secadora ni plancha. Así mantiene la compresión y la forma lavado tras lavado.</p>"
          }
        },
        "devoluciones": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "return",
            "heading": "Cambios y devoluciones",
            "row_content": "<p>Tienes 30 días desde la entrega para probar la prenda. Si no te convence, escríbenos y gestionamos la devolución sin complicaciones.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "envio",
        "tallas",
        "cuidados",
        "devoluciones"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "caption": "",
        "heading": "Antes de comprar",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "heading_alignment": "center",
        "layout": "section",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "container_color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "open_first_collapsible_row": true,
        "image_ratio": "adapt",
        "desktop_layout": "image_second",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
    "related-products": {
      "type": "related-products",
      "settings": {
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "products_to_show": 4,
        "columns_desktop": 4,
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "image_ratio": "square",
        "image_shape": "default",
        "show_secondary_image": true,
        "show_vendor": false,
        "show_rating": false,
        "columns_mobile": "2",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 28
      }
    },
    "disclosures": {
      "type": "disclosures",
      "settings": {
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    }
  },
  "order": [
    "main",
    "collapsible-content",
    "related-products",
    "disclosures"
  ]
}
